    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>This insect's compound eyes and quiet yet powerful wings make it an excellent aerial hunter.</p><p><strong>Size</strong> Medium</p><p><strong>Melee</strong> <span class=\"pf2-icon\">1</span> mandible, <strong>Damage</strong> 1d6 piercing plus Grab</p><p><strong>Str</strong> +3, <strong>Dex</strong> +3, <strong>Con</strong> +1, <strong>Int</strong> –4, <strong>Wis</strong> +1, <strong>Cha</strong> +0</p><p><strong>Hit Points</strong> 4</p><p><strong>Skill</strong> Stealth</p><p><strong>Senses</strong> darkvision</p><p><strong>Speed</strong> 20 feet, fly 60 feet</p><p><strong>Support Benefit</strong> Your giant dragonfly soars, potentially carrying off a foe with it. Until the start of your next turn, when you hit and deal damage to a creature within your giant dragonfly's reach, the giant dragonfly can Fly as a free action. If your giant dragonfly has a creature @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained}, it can carry the creature with it, treating all spaces as difficult terrain.</p><p><strong>Advanced Maneuver</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-animal-companions.AC-Advanced-Maneuvers.Item.GU0PFBSV7n5Ge0j8]{Dragonfly Swoop}</p>"
    },
